-scss-module__4Dj4Sq__searchIcon\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/search.svg\"/><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search blogs here\" class=\"SearchContainer-module-scss-module__4Dj4Sq__input\" value=\"\"/></div></div><div class=\"SearchContainer-module-scss-module__4Dj4Sq__searchBtnWrap\"><button class=\"SearchContainer-module-scss-module__4Dj4Sq__searchBtn\">Search</button></div></div><p class=\"SearchContainer-module-scss-module__4Dj4Sq__searchDesc\">Explore our insider guides and professional tips to make the most of every destination and elevate your travel experience</p></div></div></div></div></div><div id=\"blog-trending\"><section class=\"BlogTrending-module-scss-module__3bXc5q__section\"><div class=\"BlogTrending-module-scss-module__3bXc5q__container\"><div class=\"BlogTrending-module-scss-module__3bXc5q__sectionHeaderWrap\"><div class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__header SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__center\"><span class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__label\"><img alt=\"Trips\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__labelIcon\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/trips2.svg\"/>Blogs</span><h2 class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__heading  \">What&#x27;s Trending Now</h2><p class=\"SectionHeader-module-scss-module__J6xJhW__description\">Stay ahead of the curve with our most-read stories and trending travel insights across the country</p></div></div><div class=\"BlogTrending-module-scss-module__3bXc5q__grid\"><article class=\"BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__card\"><div class=\"BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__imageWrap\"><img alt=\"Egypt in Summer vs Winter: When Is the Best Time?\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=