orget Everything Else\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__image\" style=\"position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;color:transparent\" sizes=\"100vw\" srcSet=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=640&amp;q=75 640w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=750&amp;q=75 750w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=828&amp;q=75 828w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=1080&amp;q=75 1080w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=1200&amp;q=75 1200w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=1920&amp;q=75 1920w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=2048&amp;q=75 2048w, /_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75 3840w\" src=\"/_next/image?url=%2Fimages%2Fhome%2Fhero-bg.png&amp;w=3840&amp;q=75\"/></div><div class=\"BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__body\"><span class=\"BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__category BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__orange\">Adventure</span><h3 class=\"BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__title\">7 Adventures in Egypt That&#x27;ll Make You Forget Everything Else</h3><p class=\"BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__excerpt\">From dune bashing in the White Desert to snorkeling in the Red Sea, here are our top picks for thrill seekers.</p></div><div class=\"BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__footer\"><a class=\"BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__read\" href=\"/blogs/3\">Read blog<img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/arrows/arrow-right-blue3.svg\"/></a><span class=\"BlogCard-module-scss-module__51QHiq__date\"><img alt=\"Date\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/images/clock.svg\"/>15 April 2026</span></div></article><article class=\"BlogCa